cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Interactive Ricci Flow"
abstract: >-
  An interactive web tool for Ricci-flow community detection on networks, and
  a framework for experimenting with the method. It runs the flow with
  Ollivier-Ricci or Forman-Ricci curvature, scores the communities against
  ground truth, and lets people steer the flow live. The computation is a
  Python package that can be changed and run from a local server.
